    <briefdescription>
<para>Snapshot of the current leader lease. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A lease is valid when <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_leader_lease_1a699bf538e3584a891040a1bc2cd2a3da" kindref="member">owner_node_id</ref></computeroutput> is non-empty and <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_leader_lease_1af3b6a81bec85f0f52eda86c7176e404a" kindref="member">expires_at</ref></computeroutput> is in the future. The <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_leader_lease_1ad44f5e03658e53d19b3c72693aa99c75" kindref="member">epoch</ref></computeroutput> counter increments each time ownership changes, allowing callers to detect stale leases that happen to re-acquire the same node ID. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
